1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Making friends after 35
isn't emotionally hard.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
It's operationally annoying.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Everyone's calendar is full.
Everyone's default is home.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,500
Nothing repeats unless
someone makes it repeat.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,500
Which means friendship at this age
is an operations problem. Scheduling. Follow-up. Recurrence.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,500
And operations problems
have systems. Not vibes. Systems.

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Try the 7-day plan. Link in bio.
